he uses his  grappling line to grab hold of his  weapon to knock out two of the bad guys  that's pretty cool the remaining bounty  hunter who's like three feet tall  threatens to hurt baby yoda and once  again the mandalorian expresses how far  he's willing to go to protect him  if you put one mark on him there's no  place you will be able to hide from me  he trades his jetpack in exchange for  the child which of course  completely backfires for this greedy  bounty hunter you may also notice a  mando still covered in the acidic slime  from the krait dragon that armor was  able to protect him from the acid and  may offer some clues as to how boba fett  survived the sarlacc pit in return of  the jedi we know from last episode that  krait dragons eat  sarlaccs i've done tattooing my whole  life there's no such  thing as an abandoned store like pit  there is if you eat the sarlacc  and that sarlaccs take years to digest  their victims  as you are slowly digested over a  thousand years  what if one of these dragons ate the  sarlacc boba fett was in and he was able  to escape  out of that dragons similar to how the  mandalorian was able to escape  back at the cantina mando meets up with  pele motto who's having a friendly game  of sabbac with dr mandible savak is the  card game lando carissian plays in solo  and  speaking of solo you can see the blaster  mark from a new hope in the concept art  for this scene at the end of the episode  dr mandible was also seen five episodes  ago when mando first made his appearance  on tatooine  there's also a frog person in that  episode now i'm not that great at  telling frog people apart so i'll let  you decide if that's the same frog lady  mando later joins up with fun fact frog  lady is played by the same performance  artist who did all of queel's work in  season 1.  over some delicious crate meet pelly  tells mando that this mysterious  passenger needs safe travel to the  estuary moon planet of trask  located one system over from tatooine in  exchange she'll tell him where a group  of mandalorians have been hiding out  perhaps one that escaped navarro it  makes me wonder  if there are indeed mandalorians hiding  there will he be reunited with the  armorer and if she'll be able to fix  that old boba fett armor the passenger  has requested a travel sublight meaning  not light speed apparently traveling any  faster will destroy the eggs she's  trying to fertilize  if only she knew the biggest threat to  her eggs would be baby yoda  although the episode focuses heavily on  the child we don't get to see him use  much of his powers like we've seen in  the past  the closest we get is him moving the  eggs in their liquid tank  manda wakes up to an incoming call from  two new republic x-wing starfighters  one is held by captain carson tiva who  for you canadians out there might  remember the actor from a show called  kim's convenience  the other is trapper wolf played by dave  filoni the showrunner of the mandalorian  and who we previously saw in chapter 6  taking on malik's space station  they pulled over mando because he's not  running a beacon something that allows  the new republic patrol ships to see  who's in their system and if mando can't  give them the proper credentials he'll  have to be escorted to adelphi a new  republic outpost  he makes a run for it knowing his ping  will alert them to a warrant on his head  for  infiltrating the prison ship known as  balthan5  we saw his exploits on this ship in  episode 6 when he was tasked with  rescuing a prisoner known as  kin mando is able to evade the x-wings  by diving through the atmosphere of the  ice planet maldo-crace  but the strain on his ship is too much  and it crash lands among a frozen cave  system  according to wookipedia this is the same  ice planet we saw in  episode 1 where mando escaped a vicious  ravenic and baby oda eats another egg  with nowhere to go mando suggests they  sleep while they can but lady frog's  time is precious  s