ing what he did way back in  chapter 6.  apparently security reports show that  the mandalorian was integral in bringing  down three priority culprits from the  wanted register as well  it showed his efforts to protect  lieutenant davin you may remember daven  as being the only humanoid crew member  on the prison ship  he was killed by the twilak mercenary  gian in exchange for erasing his warrant  they want mando to make sure his  transponder is fixed  so the next time he's in the system they  won't vaporize him and with the ship  barely able to make it out they continue  on to the estuary moon of trask with  only the cockpit of the razor crest  pressurized for space travel so it looks  like next episode will be on this new  planet a planet which apparently has a  mandalorian covenant where he might get  answers about both baby yoda  and the boba fett armor will we see boba  next episode and is moff gideon still on  its tracks  we'll just have to wait next week to  find out thanks for watching everyone if  you liked the video be sure to give it a  like  subscribe and share with your friends  you can also follow me on twitter and  instagram at thinkstoryyt  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much
 

